=== implementation shortfall (Perold 1988) ===
arrival=100.00 paper_value=100000000 realized=98961579 IS=1038421 IS_bps=103.8
volume_weighted_arrival_slip_bps=103.8  (== IS_bps; identical to Perold IS, not a second metric)
